				<r3d:description language="eng">NewPsy4u is a secure data archiving and HPC processing system. The NewPsy4u platform uses a robust infrastructure to provide researchers with a simple interface for analysing, searching, retrieving and disseminating their biomedical data. With hundreds of investigators across the globe and more than few thousand of downloadable attributes, NewPsy4u aims to become a widespread resource for brain analyses. NewPsy4u platform guarantees reliability with a fault-tolerant network to prevent system failure.</r3d:description>
